@startuml sequence_diagram_login_failure
title SD 2 - Failed local login
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor "System user" as User
box "SPA" #F3F7FD
  participant LocalSignInForm as Form
  participant authApi as Client
end box
box "Backend" #F5F8F5
  participant AuthRoutes as Routes
  participant AuthController as Controller
  participant UserService as Service
  participant UserRepository as Repo
  participant BcryptPasswordHasher as Hasher
end box

User -> Form : submit email and password
Form -> Client : login(credentials)
Client -> Routes : POST /api/v1/auth/login
alt Request limit exceeded or malformed input
  Routes --> Client : 429 or 400
else Well-formed request within limit
  Routes -> Controller : login(req, res)
  Controller -> Service : login(LoginDTO)
  Service -> Repo : findByEmail(canonical email)
  Repo --> Service : User or no account
  Service -> Hasher : compare(password, stored or dummy hash)
  Hasher --> Service : comparison result
  alt Unknown email, no local password or wrong password
    Service --> Controller : 401 Invalid email or password
    Controller --> Client : generic 401 response
  else Correct password, but account inactive or without an active role
    Service -> Service : assertCanAccess(user) (AA03)
    Service --> Controller : 403 access denied
    Controller --> Client : 403 response
  end
end
Client --> Form : request error
Form --> User : display error and keep sign-in available

note over Service
  A local registration remains inactive until AA07 activates it.
  No access token is issued on these paths.
end note
@enduml
